import "../core-architecture.rq" as core_architecture
import "../codestyle/typescript.rq" as typescript_codestyle

event_driven the application should be event driven.

state_machine_mindset {
    The application should be designed as a collection of state machines.
    The core index lifecycle FSM lives in the Rust runtime (["../core_analysis/rust_port.rq".native_bridge]); Svelte
    webview UI follows [typescript_codestyle.ui_state_management] and [typescript_codestyle.zustand_boundary]
    (runes AppState, no zustand). No JS zustand stores remain.
}